WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:08.767
The ghost arrow now attaches to whichever edge is closest to the pointer. Move around the target card to choose its left, top, right or bottom edge before connecting.

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:14.631
A click connects the chosen edges. The arrow keeps those attachment points after a reload.

00:00:15.586 --> 00:00:20.474
The trash button stays at the middle of the arrow. After confirmation it removes the manual connection.
